    {
      "id": "claim_784f814dd30d4a4f8b783489a57509f2",
      "statement": "OxyromonMcp::run_action fans the same {prefix}_started/_complete/_error triple into the web server's broadcast channel, but only in server builds where self.sse_tx is Some (i.e. mounted at /mcp by mcp_http_service, which calls with_sse) *and* the tool passed an sse_prefix. The prefixes used are import_dats, download_dats, sort_roms, check_roms, convert_roms, purge_roms, purge and purge_irds; import_roms and set_setting pass None and therefore emit nothing to /events.",
