      "id": "claim_e2fa6b49c6cb4329b9b2524d8cbaed2f",
      "statement": "connect_sse opens one EventSource('/events') for the SPA's whole lifetime and leaks its closures. Because EventSource reconnects by itself but never replays missed events, it installs an onopen handler that resets every in-flight flag (purging_system_id, sorting_system_id, checking_system_id, purging_irds_system_id, generating_playlists, purging_roms) on every opening including the first, and registers on_finished to clear each flag on {prefix}_complete *or* {prefix}_error so neither outcome can strand a spinner.",
