    {
      "id": "claim_6a9a1daba64e4133bf3896597a3ca245",
      "statement": "The frontend treats the _complete payload semantically: data.skipped true renders a warning toast and skips the refresh (an already-current DAT changed nothing), while a payload whose system_id equals the current selection resets system_id to the -1 sentinel because a purged system has nothing left to fetch; otherwise state.refresh() refetches what is on screen. Toast text is taken verbatim from the event's `message` field.",
