    {
      "id": "claim_a32ee14580fe4b718c2709b0f68e087f",
      "statement": "/events is reached same-origin in every deployment: the embedded SPA is served from the same listener, the Tauri shell spawns `oxyromon server` on an ephemeral loopback port and points the webview at that origin, and in development `trunk serve` proxies /events to http://127.0.0.1:8000/events. The route has no authentication, so it is readable by anything that can reach the bound address.",
